    "identifier": "hebi-basilisk-art-viper-leash",
    "description": "<p>You call upon your venomous heritage, summoning a serpent like construct made of your Viper Blood, that you command to lash out. Make a melee Ninjutsu attack against a creature in range, dealing 6d6 poison damage, and forcing an affected creature to make a Strength saving throw, being Restrained in place on a failure.</p>\n<p>They remake this saving throw at the end of each of their turns. On a failure, they take 2d6 poison damage and gain 1 rank of Envenomed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the number of creatures you can target with this jutsu by +1.</p>",
